WEBVTT

00:12:28.196 --> 00:12:31.316
and maybe someday there will be
something like "The World Talks,"

00:12:31.316 --> 00:12:33.876
with hundreds of thousands
of participants.

00:12:33.916 --> 00:12:38.076
But what matters here are not the numbers,

00:12:39.076 --> 00:12:40.396
obviously.

00:12:41.716 --> 00:12:43.196
What matters here is ...

00:12:43.756 --> 00:12:47.796
Whenever two people meet
to talk in person for hours

00:12:47.836 --> 00:12:51.036
without anyone else listening,

00:12:51.036 --> 00:12:52.196
they change.

00:12:52.716 --> 00:12:54.276
And so do our societies.

00:12:54.316 --> 00:12:58.076
They change little by little,
discussion by discussion.

00:12:58.076 --> 00:13:01.076
What matters here is that we relearn